OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after pedestrian seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old driver has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a pedestrian was hit by a car in
OL,8,FCoventry at around 02:00 GMT on
OL,9,FSaturday morning.
OL,11,FThe pedestrian "is currently in a
OL,12,Fserious condition in hospital", said
OL,13,FWest Midlands Police.
OL,15,FThe force said the man was hit by a
OL,16,FMazda near the junction of Stoney
OL,17,FStanton Road and Ordnance Road.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
