OL,4,Ahurt in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver was arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving, driving while unfit through
OL,9,Fdrink or drugs, and possession of Class
OL,10,FB or C drugs.
